{"tool_name":"bioconductor-speckle","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"bioconductor-speckle","home":"https://bioconductor.org/packages/speckle","license":"GPL-3.0","summary":"The speckle package contains functions for the analysis of single cell RNA-seq data. The speckle package currently contains functions to analyse differences in cell type proportions. There are also functions to estimate the parameters of the Beta distribution based on a given counts matrix, and a function to normalise a counts matrix to the median library size. There are plotting functions to visualise cell type proportions and the mean-variance relationship in cell type proportions and counts. As our research into specialised analyses of single cell data continues we anticipate that the package will be updated with new functions.","addition_date":"2026-09-01T07:31:57.883224Z","last_update_date":"2026-09-01T07:31:57.884953Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool","Library"],"version":["1.12.0"],"collections":["BioConductor"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:bioconductor-speckle","credit":[{"name":"Belinda Phipson","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Developer","Maintainer"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["User manual"],"url":"https://bioconductor.org/packages/speckle"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"name":"speckle","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"gh2biotools","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/bioinformatics/btac582"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"speckle","home":"https://bio.tools/bioconductor-speckle","license":"GPL-3.0-only","version":"1.12.0","summary":"The speckle package contains functions for the analysis of single cell RNA-seq data. The speckle package currently contains functions to analyse differences in cell type proportions. There are also functions to estimate the parameters of the Beta distribution based on a given counts matrix, and a function to normalise a counts matrix to the median library size. There are plotting functions to